  m_text: "Welcome, balloonist! \nThe Blons tournament is a classic armed speed ascent
    competition. Ascend as fast as possible.\n\nPick up balloons and fill them using
    the trigger. The more ballons you have in your canopy the faster you will rise.\n\nUse
    your weapons to defend yourself. Watch out for birds and other competitors.\n\n\n"
